    <briefdescription>
<para>Handles MVCC_CLEANUP by GC-ing all MVCC tombstones older than a configurable watermark. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Registered by the StorageEngine at startup: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Retain<sp/>versions<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>last<sp/>24<sp/>hours.</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">orchestrator.registerTaskHandler(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1maintenance_1ab547ef77e5b6037445a31f13bf5e2fa8a5daef987791f6d59d0292b235ab51ba3" kindref="member">MaintenanceTaskType::MVCC_CLEANUP</ref>,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::make_shared&lt;MvccCleanupHandler&gt;(mvcc_store,<sp/>86400000));</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>watermark_ms</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Versions older than now() - watermark_ms are eligible for garbage collection. Defaults to 24 hours. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
